# Phase 7: spice-write: CDL instance names (P7-8). An instance is named as
# the name map declares it (its letter, then its name: `XX1` stays `XX1`),
# not the old layout's rule, which dropped an `X` after the letter (`XX1`
# was `X1`, which the deck may declare too).
