# Phase 7: spice-write: VACASK control lines (FINDINGS-A, S-class). A VACASK
# `control` line the reader kept as text is no longer copied as a card onto
# the SPICE targets and CDL (`abort always` was an A element to ngspice):
# `abort`, `print`, `postprocess` steer only the script (VACASK
# simulator/cmd.cpp) and are left out (W0025), `save` too (W0023); `elaborate`,
# `alter`, `var`, `clear` change what runs and are refused W0001 (CDL leaves
# them out, W0028).
vacask/benchmark/graetz/vacask/debug_graetz.sim cdl its VACASK abort/print lines are left out (W0025), no longer copied as cards
vacask/benchmark/graetz/vacask/debug_graetz.sim espice its VACASK abort/print lines are left out (W0025), no longer copied as cards
